# Boot into the game and park the cursor out of the way.
#
# Three space bars: Legend logo, demon cutscene, title screen. Each is a
# "press any key" gate, and the run counts between them are the animation
# lengths -- pressing too early is swallowed rather than skipping ahead.
#
# The cursor is parked at (305,196), outside the picture window and clear of
# every hotspot, so that a checkpoint hash taken afterwards records the room
# rather than whatever the mouse happened to be hovering over.

run 60
key 32
run 40
key 32
run 40
key 32
run 60
move 305 196
run 15

move 200 55
run 10
click left
run 30
move 305 196
run 10
checkpoint context_computer
shot build/frames/context_fresh.bmp
move 14 7
run 15
checkpoint context_hover_7
shot build/frames/context_row_7.bmp
move 14 17
run 15
checkpoint context_hover_17
shot build/frames/context_row_17.bmp
